      "name": "Backup Battery Charge",
      "desc": "Once Battery Charge reaches 240, recover 1 Backup Battery Charge every 18 minutes. You can have up to 2,400 Backup Battery Charge.\nConsume Backup Battery Charge to gain an equal amount of Battery Charge.",
      "desc2": "Battery Charge stored in a backup battery, ready for use whenever needed.\nIf Ether technology can be applied to produce batteries, their efficiency might be further improved. Luckily, this backup battery has a large capacity, turning Battery Charge into a valuable long-term asset.",
